---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../../lib/site.mjs';
---
<Page title="Privacy Policy | CarSpecFix" description="How CarSpecFix handles your data: what we collect, cookies, and how to contact us." path="/privacy/" crumbs={[{ name: 'Home', url: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy', url: '/privacy/' }]} h1={`Privacy Policy`}>
<p class="meta">Effective October 16, 2026</p>
<h2 class="section__title">What we collect</h2>
<p>We do not require accounts and do not sell personal data. We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which does not use cookies, to count visits in aggregate. Our host (Cloudflare) processes standard request logs — including your IP address and user-agent — to deliver and secure the site. These logs are retained by Cloudflare for a limited period and are not used to identify you personally.</p>
<h2 class="section__title">Correction reports</h2>
<p>If you report a data error through our contact form, we store the page URL, the field you flagged, and your description so we can review and fix it. We do not ask for or store payment, location, or other sensitive personal information.</p>
<h2 class="section__title">Your data rights</h2>
<p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct, or delete the personal data we hold about you. To exercise these rights, email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> with the subject “Data request.” We respond within 30 days.</p>
<h2 class="section__title">Changes</h2>
<p>If we add advertising in the future, this policy will be updated before ads appear. Questions: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
</Page>
